                                                "sense_id": "88649924-2656-3cdb-bc3e-36d9dfba3932",
                                                "text": "In “A Carcass,” embryogeny is reversed. Death, forcing the beloved to imitate the animal's deconstruction, will make her surrender gender, identity, and coherence."
